            <div xml:id="d636">

                <pb facs="0701" n="1379" sameAs="frus:frus1863p2/pg1379"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Mr. Lawrence to Mr.
                        Seward.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#float-left">No. 11.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Consulate General of the United
                                States</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic">Florence</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1863-03-02"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >March</hi> 2, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> In accordance with the request made by the
                    Secretary of State in circular No. 30, I transmit herewith copies of the royal
                    decrees of King Victor <pb facs="0702" n="1380" xml:id="pg1380"/> Emanuel of
                    October 29, 1861, and September 11, 1862, establishing for the kingdom of Italy
                    a uniform system of rules and regulations for the collection of external revenue
                    and customs dues.</p>
                <p>These documents will be found to contain answers to most of the queries
                    propounded by the secretary in the above circular, so far as this kingdom is
                    concerned.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">* * * * * * * * *</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>T. BIGELOW LAWRENCE, <hi rendition="#italic">Consul
                        General.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Frederick</hi> W. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">Seward</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic">Assistant
                            Secretary of State, Washington.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
